    "html": "<div class=\"pacer-layout\">\n    <div class=\"card pacer\" data-accent=\"violet\" id=\"pacer\">\n      <span class=\"kicker-small\">Resonant field pacer</span>\n      <h3 class=\"pacer-phase\" id=\"pacer-phase-name\">Phase 1: Ground State</h3>\n      <div class=\"pacer-orb-wrap\">\n        <div class=\"pacer-orb\" id=\"pacer-orb\">\n          <span class=\"pacer-prompt\" id=\"pacer-prompt\">Ready</span>\n          <span class=\"pacer-time\" id=\"pacer-time\">05:00</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pacer-ring\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pacer-controls\">\n        <button class=\"button dark\" id=\"pacer-toggle\" type=\"button\">Start session</button>\n        <button class=\"button\" id=\"pacer-reset\" type=\"button\">Reset</button>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"pacer-audio\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"pacer-audio\" checked> <span id=\"pacer-audio-label\">Audio carrier — 943 Hz left + 983 Hz right (40 Hz difference; 963 Hz center)</span></label>\n      <p class=\"pacer-status\" id=\"pacer-status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Six phases of five minutes. Choose any phase or begin with Ground State. The orb breathes on a 14-second cycle: inhale 4 s, hold 4 s, exhale 6 s.</p>\n      <p class=\"pacer-note\">For meditation and creative visualization only — not a method for changing DNA, gene activity, or telomeres. The named center frequencies are aesthetic sonic anchors, not biological targets. Headphones are required for the binaural effect. Begin at a low volume and stop if the sound is uncomfortable.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card phases\" data-accent=\"teal\">\n      <h3 class=\"card-kicker\">The six-phase meditation sequence</h3>\n      <ol class=\"phase-list\" id=\"pacer-phases\">\n        <li data-phase=\"1\" class=\"active\" data-accent=\"teal\"><button class=\"phase-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><div class=\"phase-list-head\"><h4>1. Ground State · 963 Hz</h4><span>00:00 – 05:00</span></div><p>Lengthen the spine and soften the gaze. Let the breath settle while the 963 Hz center serves as a simple sonic anchor; there is no state to force.</p></button></li>\n        <li data-phase=\"2\" data-accent=\"blue\"><button class=\"phase-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><div class=\"phase-list-head\"><h4>2. Clearing the Noise · 852 Hz</h4><span>05:00 – 10:00</span></div><p>Picture static and unwanted signal activity receding. “Parasitic DNA” and LINE-1 are symbolic imagery here, not a claim that sound removes genetic material.</p></button></li>\n        <li data-phase=\"3\" data-accent=\"violet\"><button class=\"phase-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><div class=\"phase-list-head\"><h4>3. Coherent Blueprint · 741 Hz</h4><span>10:00 – 15:00</span></div><p>Hold a clear organizing pattern in awareness. Notice steadiness, spacious attention, and continuity without assigning the image a biological effect.</p></button></li>\n        <li data-phase=\"4\" data-accent=\"rose\"><button class=\"phase-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><div class=\"phase-list-head\"><h4>4. Repolymerization · 528 Hz</h4><span>15:00 – 20:00</span></div><p>Imagine repair as patient reweaving: gaps closing, continuity returning, and structure becoming legible. This is contemplative imagery, not induced DNA synthesis.</p></button></li>\n        <li data-phase=\"5\" data-accent=\"amber\"><button class=\"phase-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><div class=\"phase-list-head\"><h4>5. Telomere Shelter · 639 Hz</h4><span>20:00 – 25:00</span></div><p>Picture each chromosome end sheltered and intact, with the telomere held inside a protective cap. Rest in continuity rather than striving for extension.</p></button></li>\n        <li data-phase=\"6\" data-accent=\"green\"><button class=\"phase-select\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><div class=\"phase-list-head\"><h4>6. Integration &amp; Seal · 432 Hz</h4><span>25:00 – 30:00</span></div><p>Let the sequence settle. Imagine renewed material integrated, unnecessary noise quiet, and the whole system returning gently to ordinary awareness.</p></button></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
